  "body": "If family living, extra space and a great location are on your wish list, then 12 Rakino Ave deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a much-loved, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this beautifully presented character home offers three bedrooms, 1 bathroom, a double garage PLUS a large consented studio with its own bathroom and office nook,  giving you so many options for family living, working from home, guests or extended family.\r\nThe main home has been thoughtfully updated, retaining its character while bringing in the comforts of modern living. From the renovated open-plan kitchen to the choice of two fabulous outdoor entertaining areas and an oversized yard. This home makes living and entertaining easy, while its elevated position offers expansive views across Manly.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the studio.\r\nSet privately at the rear, this fantastic addition really sets the property apart. Teenagers can have their own space, grandparents or guests can stay comfortably, or you could create a dedicated work-from-home zone away from the main living areas. There's even a little office nook for those who need it. \r\nOutside, the property is fully fenced for privacy, with an electric front gate. With a generous front lawn and parking, a double garage, a spa pool to keep the adults and kids entertained, and plenty of space for the pets to roam, there's room for everyone to relax, unwind, and enjoy. There's also potential here to explore future options, including a pool or minor dwelling, subject to council approvals.\r\nLocation is another big part of the appeal.\r\n\r\nFrom the end of the cul-de-sac, a handy walkway provides safe access to Whangaparaoa Primary and kindergarten without crossing main roads, a real bonus for families. Add Manly's beaches, village, cafes and relaxed coastal lifestyle, and you have a location that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that gives you space, flexibility, privacy and lifestyle, all located on the desirable Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nCome and see what makes 12 Rakino Avenue so special. \r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: 4.00pm Wednesday 28 October, 2026 at Ray White Manly offices (unless sold prior)",
